{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04586","headline":"五君咏五首 苏许公瓌 · 张说","name":"五君咏五首 苏许公瓌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"许公信国桢，克美具瞻情。\n百事资朝问，三章广世程。\n处高心不有，临节自爲名。\n朱户传新戟，青松拱旧茔。\n凄凉丞相府，余庆在玄成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}